{"id":"0c784c857687fd14","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-extensionality.md","title":"Extensionality","display":"thm-extensionality — Extensionality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-extensionality","aliases":["58-thm-extensionality"],"display":"thm-extensionality — Extensionality","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[58-ax-ext]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-extensionality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-extensionality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-extensionality — Extensionality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7dd3434f494dba6e\" href=\"?note=7dd3434f494dba6e\" title=\"58-ax-ext\">58-ax-ext</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span>（集合，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>（集合论语言的隶属关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extensionality}\\vdash \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;\\left(x=y\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\;(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extensionality}\\vdash \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;\\left(x=y\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\;(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Two sets are equal iff they have the same elements.</li>\n<li>从右向左使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7dd3434f494dba6e\" href=\"?note=7dd3434f494dba6e\" title=\"58-ax-ext\">58-ax-ext</a>；从左向右使用一阶等号的替换规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-ext","status":"resolved","id":"7dd3434f494dba6e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-ext]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y,z$（集合，见 [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-ext","status":"resolved","id":"7dd3434f494dba6e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"从右向左使用 [[58-ax-ext]]；从左向右使用一阶等号的替换规则。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extensionality}\\vdash \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;\\left(x=y\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\;(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":728,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-extensionality.md|58-thm-extensionality]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","7dd3434f494dba6e"]}